Z||000000||rogergarrison||04-24-2001||09:54 AM||||Sunday June 10, my sports car club (European Sports Car Club) is hosting a run for cash. Starts just south of Newark and runs lots of back roads, hills, curves to Old Mans Cave in Logan. Its not a speed event but lots of fun. You make several stops along the way to pick up playing cards. At the cave, also a state park, we have an area to be roped off for a car show for other park visitors. Winning poker hand takes home 1/2 the total cash. $10 per person/car. Any car is welcome. email me if you want any further info.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
